    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiggly Strike is a fun, fast-paced, cartoon style arcade volleyball game with snappy controls. Play unique characters on diverse courts in matches against AI or your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels in 6 unique themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique characters with different strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 gameplay modes: PvP, PvAI, AIvAI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique court gameplay elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression - unlock levels, characters and more in matches against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization - Change color, hat and accessory of your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remote play with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules configuration - Change round points, max side hit amount or gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple languages</p></li></ul>",
